{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "64b9423c-2d74-8d94-ae6f-96bb38fb3189",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T11:33:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bruce Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Greg. My name is Bruce Peckham. I have a question about a dumpster on the street. A permit for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Is it going in front of a house, or a business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at my property, sixty-six Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward. We are doing work inside the building and I need a dumpster for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And will the dumpster be in your driveway, or on the street itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the street. There is no driveway space. And the problem is, in front is a no-parking zone. So what are the rules for a dumpster in a no-parking zone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, a dumpster on a public street needs a permit, and a no-parking zone is not something you can just ignore. They'll look at where it sits, whether it blocks traffic or sight lines, that kind of thing. In some spots they won't allow it at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So it may be no, even with the permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be. It depends on the location. You'd want to give them the exact spot when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, one moment. [pause] My grandchild is here and she is singing the same song, again and again. I apologize for the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I can hear her. She's got it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, she does. Now, my next question. Must a licensed contractor be the one to apply? Or can I, the owner, apply for it myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the dumpster company or the contractor handles it, and a lot of times they've done it before so it goes smoother. But if you're the owner you can ask about applying yourself. I'd confirm that with the permit desk when you file, since they'll tell you what they need from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I should ask the permit desk directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Bring the address, the dates you need it, the size of the dumpster, and where on the street it's going to sit. If the contractor's doing the work, have their information handy too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. The dates I will have. The size, I will ask the company."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Do you want me to transfer you over to the permit desk now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. But if the line is busy, is there a number I can call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're calling the main line, and it'll ring through to the same people. If they don't pick up, just call back this department and ask for permits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. My number, in case, is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-six. Hold on, I'll send you through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Greg. God bless you and your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Peckham. Happy New Year. Here we go."
    }
  ],
